//   The Zicbom extension adds the CBCFE (Cache Block Clean and Flush instruction Enable) field to
//     henvcfg. When V=1, if the CBO.CLEAN and CBO.FLUSH instructions are not HS-qualified, they
//     raise an illegal-instruction exception. If the instructions are HS-qualified and the CBCFE
//     field is set to 1, the instructions are enabled for execution; otherwise, if the CBCFE field
//     is set to 0, they raise a virtual-instruction exception. When the Zicbom extension is not
